Subject: [PATCH 11/11] allow list hypervisor to soong build for macOS host
 tools

Summary:
# Motivation:
an earlier change needs to link with this dylib
# Overview:
- add framework Hypervisor to list of allowed dylibs

Test Plan:
```
 . build/envsetup.sh && lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug && m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz
```
